CLOSE DATA
SELE A
USE STOREBPR ORDER STORESR
*USE BPRDATA
GO TOP
SELE B
USE CBBPR

DO WHILE .NOT. EOF()
  SELE A
  GO TOP
  LOCATE FOR  BPRSRNO= B->BPRSRNO
                   REPL B->QUANTITY WITH A->QUANTITY
                   REPL B->BATCH WITH A->BATCH
                   REPL B->ADITICODE WITH A->ADITICODE
                   REPL B->CIPORDNO WITH A->CIPORDNO
     SELE B
     SKIP
ENDDO     